      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just weird seeing everything move so fast. everything i spent 30 years mastering is basically just noise now. like i'm looking at a world that doesn't even have a slot for someone like me anymore. kind of makes you feel like a ghost, u know? just a relic that people look past.",
